  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Hippolord About Story",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "story",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "image_left",
            "eyebrow": "IT STARTED WITH A SIMPLE BELIEF",
            "heading": "It began with an afternoon of old photos.",
            "body": "<p>One day, Jenny was sitting with her mom and looking through photos from her childhood. Some images brought everything back instantly: a place, a laugh, a tiny detail she had not thought about in years.</p><p>Others made her realize how much time can quietly erase. Moments that once felt impossible to forget had become blurry around the edges.</p>",
            "quote": "That was the beginning of Hippolord: a way to turn memories into something you can keep close."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "statement",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "MADE FROM YOUR MOMENTS",
            "heading": "MEMORIES FADE. MEANING DOESN’T HAVE TO.",
            "body": "<p>A photo, a name, a date, a family joke — ordinary details can hold an entire chapter of someone’s life.</p>",
            "background": "#F5E6EA",
            "text_color": "#2B2325",
            "muted_color": "#6F6266",
            "accent_color": "#88283F",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "story",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "image_right",
            "eyebrow": "FROM ORDINARY TO ONLY YOURS",
            "heading": "The product may be ordinary. What it carries is not.",
            "body": "<p>A T-shirt is something we wear every day. A mug is something we reach for without thinking. A blanket is simply part of home.</p><p>But add the right photo, the right words, or a memory only two people understand, and that ordinary object can suddenly mean far more than the object itself.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "statement",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "HIPPOLORD",
            "heading": "WHY HIPPOLORD?",
            "body": "<p>The name Hippolord is built around contrast: something bold and larger-than-life on the outside, with warmth, gentleness and playfulness within.</p><p>That contrast mirrors what we make. The object itself may be simple — a shirt, a mug, a blanket — but the feeling it can carry for the person receiving it can be enormous.</p>",
            "background": "#6F1E33",
            "text_color": "#FFF9F6",
            "muted_color": "#E8D8DD",
            "accent_color": "#F5E8D7",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "story",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "image_left",
            "eyebrow": "MADE FOR THE MOMENTS THAT MATTER",
            "heading": "We make things for the moments you do not want to lose.",
            "body": "<p>Birthdays, weddings, anniversaries and holidays matter. So do the quieter memories: sitting with Mom, laughing at an old photo, remembering a nickname, or finding a picture you thought you had forgotten.</p><p>Those are the moments we want to help you keep close.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "story",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "image_right",
            "eyebrow": "PERSONAL FEELS DIFFERENT",
            "heading": "A gift feels different when it carries a piece of your story.",
            "body": "<p>Hippolord exists to help turn personal memories into everyday objects that feel anything but ordinary.</p><p>Something familiar. Something useful. Something that can still make a person stop, smile, and remember.</p>",
            "background": "#F5E6EA"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "statement",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "THE BEST PART?",
            "heading": "THE GIFT MAY BE SIMPLE. THE MEANING CAN BE HUGE.",
            "body": "<p>That is the heart of Hippolord. We are not trying to make ordinary products look important. We are helping the memories inside them feel visible again.</p>",
            "background": "#2B2325",
            "text_color": "#FFF9F6",
            "muted_color": "#D8CCCF",
            "accent_color": "#F5E8D7",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "cta",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "HIPPOLORD",
            "heading": "MAKE IT PERSONAL.",
            "body": "<p>For the people you love. For the memories worth keeping. For the story only you can tell.</p>",
            "primary_label": "SHOP PERSONALIZED GIFTS",
            "background": "#FFF9F6",
            "text_color": "#2B2325",
            "muted_color": "#6F6266",
            "accent_color": "#88283F"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
